{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Man, just committed his new greatest sin, trying to overcome death with a vaccine.  You will play as survivalist Austin Watts who has gotten trapped at an abandoned summer camp deep in the mountains. After establishing contact with a rescue team, you will learn you have only seven days to uncover a mystery that lies in the pines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you search for clues scattered across the campgrounds, you  use a handheld radio to communicate with your brother along with scattered survivors, gather supplies, and fight to survive against the infected that roam the forest. Every night grows darker, and every discovery brings you closer to the horrifying truth behind humanity\u2019s downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore a desolate camp, use your instincts to piece together evidence, connect the dots, and uncover the story of what really happened at Camp Hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven-day campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >various types of zombies with different behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radio communication that reveals key aspects of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day/night cycle where threats, visibility, and infected behavior shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling: logs, photos, recordings, and clues to reconstruct the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical survival combat: improvised weapons, stealth, and resource management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting system to acquire food and survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4142010?t=1774188205","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142010/72417ebac9d69ef10127c05476dd1185d15fc9