.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day/night cycle where threats, visibility, and infected behavior shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling: logs, photos, recordings, and clues to reconstruct the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical survival combat: improvised weapons, stealth, and resource management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting system to acquire food and survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["David Haynes"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142010/35a9a185b997c0dafe4301173e363f5c76313824/header.jpg?t=1774188205","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4142010/412830649/fec59f2caca0a242b690916c6d2231b2b29663ab/1761698238/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761958187","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4142010/412830649/fec59f2caca0a242b690916c6d2231b2b29663ab/1761698238/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761958187","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4142010/412830649/fec59f2caca0a242b690916c6d2231b2b29663ab/1761698238/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761958187","id":257223877,"name":"Revenant Anouncement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257223877/4dae7f6e1013a3f9457a1102bf280df3761488c3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761958187"}],"name":"Revenant","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Project 24"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":